<title>PORTUGAL: BANCO BBA CREDITANSTALT ISSUES 7.5 BLN ESC BOND.</title>
<headline>BANCO BBA CREDITANSTALT ISSUES 7.5 BLN ESC BOND.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by lead manager and bookrunner Banco Finantia.</p>
<p>    BORROWER Banco BBA Creditanstalt    AMT 7.5 billion escudos</p>
<p>    INTEREST Six months Lisbor plus 150 basis points</p>
<p>    MATURITY 10/9/2002  ISS PRICE Par</p>
<p>    PAY DATE 10/0/97    PAY FREQ  Six monthly</p>
<p>    CLEARING Euroclear and Cedel</p>
<p>    LISTING  Lux	  NEG PLG Yes     CRS DEFLT Yes</p>
<p>NOTE - Banco BBA Creditanstalt is a Brazilian joint venture between Austria's Creditanstalt-Bankverein, which is rated Aa3 by Moody's, and a group of Brazilian executives.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
